WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
The first jumping medium punch intercepts airborne Ryu with Counter Hit.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.100
The second jumping medium punch completes the airborne target.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.900
After landing, light Tomahawk Buster picks up the falling Ryu.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.300
Ryu falls after the meterless air-to-air conversion.
